          "**Laryngomalacia**: reassure when the baby thrives; small frequent upright feeds, thickened feeds and anti-reflux positioning; **supraglottoplasty** only for failure to thrive, apnoea, cyanosis or cor pulmonale. [Scott-Brown 8e]",
